Nvidia has been helping to finance the AI build-out, partly so more companies can buy its chips.

@pboockvar is asking what happens when one of those projects stalls. If Nvidia has invested in a data centre and guaranteed its lease, and it never gets built, the chips don't go in but the obligation can still be there. 

One domino tips, and the rest can follow.

